{"id":"torrey:justice-of-god-the","source":"torrey","name":"Justice Of God, The","slug":"justice-of-god-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Is a part of his character — De 32:4; Isa 45:21.","refs":[["Deut",32,4,32,4],["Isa",45,21,45,21]]},{"text":"Plenteous. — Job 37:23.","refs":[["Job",37,23,37,23]]},{"text":"Incomparable. — Job 4:1.","refs":[["Job",4,1,4,1]]},{"text":"Incorruptible. — De 10:17; 2Ch 19:7.","refs":[["Deut",10,17,10,17],["2Chr",19,7,19,7]]},{"text":"Impartial. — 2Ch 19:7; Jer 32:19.","refs":[["2Chr",19,7,19,7],["Jer",32,19,32,19]]},{"text":"Unfailing. — Zep 3:5.","refs":[["Zeph",3,5,3,5]]},{"text":"Undeviating. — Job 8:3; 34:12.","refs":[["Job",8,3,8,3],["Job",34,12,34,12]]},{"text":"Without respect of persons. — Ro 2:11; Col 3:25; 1Pe 1:17.","refs":[["Rom",2,11,2,11],["Col",3,25,3,25],["1Pet",1,17,1,17]]},{"text":"The habitation of his throne. — Ps 89:14.","refs":[["Ps",89,14,89,14]]},{"text":"Not to be sinned against — Jer 50:7.","refs":[["Jer",50,7,50,7]]},{"text":"Denied by the ungodly — Eze 33:17,20.","refs":[["Ezek",33,17,33,17],["Ezek",33,20,33,20]]},{"text":"Forgiving sins. — 1Jo 1:9.","refs":[["1John",1,9,1,9]]},{"text":"Redemption. — Ro 3:26.","refs":[["Rom",3,26,3,26]]},{"text":"His government. — Ps 9:4; Jer 9:24.","refs":[["Ps",9,4,9,4],["Jer",9,24,9,24]]},{"text":"His judgments. — Ge 18:25; Re 19:2.","refs":[["Gen",18,25,18,25],["Rev",19,2,19,2]]},{"text":"All his ways. — Eze 18:25,29.","refs":[["Ezek",18,25,18,25],["Ezek",18,29,18,29]]},{"text":"The final judgment. — Ac 17:31.","refs":[["Acts",17,31,17,31]]},{"text":"Acknowledge — Ps 51:4; Ro 3:4.","refs":[["Ps",51,4,51,4],["Rom",3,4,3,4]]},{"text":"Magnify — Ps 98:9; 99:3,4.","refs":[["Ps",98,9,98,9],["Ps",99,3,99,3],["Ps",99,4,99,4]]}],"refCount":32}
